All local gates now pass. At the hard preset the exact answer density is \(12/(16\binom{36}{6})=3.85\times10^{-7}\); 200,000 structure-aware guesses had zero hits. The reference triple-collision method solved 8/8, using up to 416,185 counted operations, while the planted row-parity route stayed at the 288-operation cap. I’m starting the required bare four-vendor hardening run.
