+    "and the paper says all calculations used Magma, so this is not a Track-A "
+    "claim. The efficient reference method is triple-syndrome collision "
+    "search. The planted basis is conditioned so individual rows, pairs, a "
+    "row-weight outlier probe, and greedy cancellation do not reveal a word; "
