 ## Caveats
 
-The compact route is deliberately basis-dependent: an arbitrary additional
-row operation destroys it, even though it preserves the code.  This benchmark
-therefore measures discovery of a planted full-basis ansatz, not general
-minimum-distance decoding or code equivalence.  The exact random-guess density
-uses a prior uniform over a valid block and a sorted six-subset; it already
-enforces all answer-format constraints but does not model syndrome-guided
-guessing.  The standard triple-collision attack succeeds as expected, so this
-family is unsuitable for Track A.  No external code-equivalence package,
-information-set decoder, or Magma routine was run; the implemented specialist
-attack is sufficient for weight six but not a benchmark of those systems.
-
-`canonical_key` uses the multiset of full block weight enumerators.  It is
-invariant under the tested row, coordinate, and block relabellings and separates
-the generated variants used in G8, but weight enumerators are not complete
-isomorphism invariants, so rare unrelated codes could collide.  Most
-importantly, no four-vendor hardness claim exists until OpenRouter quota is
-restored and all three required arms are run.
+- The family deliberately has an efficient solver and claims only Track B.
+  Exhaustive enumeration of all `2^18` codewords per block and standard
+  information-set/codeword-search methods were not included in the failing
+  attacks; the faster triple-collision method was included as the successful
+  reference algorithm.
+- The guessing probability is exact for a uniform prior over a displayed block
+  and a sorted six-subset.  It says nothing about a solver using code structure.
+- The target's row basis is conditioned so its complete parity is a weight-six
+  word.  Decoy bases are otherwise mixed in the same manner, but a stronger
+  statistical classifier over full row-weight/intersection distributions was
+  not tested.
+- `canonical_key()` uses the multiset of complete weight enumerators.  It is
+  invariant under row, coordinate, and block relabelling and correctly merges
+  this generator's transformed copies, but weight enumerators are not complete
+  invariants for arbitrary code equivalence and can over-collide outside this
+  controlled family.
+- The structural and placebo oracle arms remain unscored solely because the
+  external key quota was exhausted.  Local gates passing must not be read as a
+  substitute for the required four-vendor hardening evidence.
