codex
Implemented and verified a Track B generator based on the paper’s explicit self-dual `[36,18,6]` code and weight enumerator ([paper, Sections 1–4](https://arxiv.org/html/1012.5464v2)).

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1012.5464/gen_1012_5464.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1012.5464/selftest_report.json)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1012.5464/README.md)
- [Bare hardening transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1012.5464/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1012.5464/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1012.5464/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Results:

- All G1–G9 local gates pass.
- Shipping preset: `easy`, eight code blocks.
- Exact guess density: `12 / 15,582,336 = 7.70e-7`.
- Reference search: at most 63,098 operations.
- Intended invariant route: at most 144 operations.
- Bare oracle run: `0/3` solved; harness verdict `hardened`.
- Structural hint: `1/3` solved.
- Placebo arm remained unscored because the OpenRouter quota was exhausted; this diagnostic limitation is documented explicitly.
